{"id":"necesariamente","lemma":"necesariamente","pos":"adv","rank":3026,"glosses":["necessarily"],"ipa":"/neθeˌsaɾjaˈmente/","order":3031,"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1d/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Haylli-necesariamente.wav","examples":[{"text":"Este trabajo no es necesariamente fácil.","en":"This work is not necessarily easy.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/706061","words":[{"g":"this"},{"g":"work, job"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,{"g":"easy, facile, simple"}]},{"text":"Los hombres grandes no necesariamente son fuertes.","en":"Big men aren't necessarily strong.","words":[{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"man","l":"hombre"},{"g":"big, large","l":"grande"},{"g":"no / not"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"strong","l":"fuerte"}]},{"text":"No necesariamente es así.","en":"It isn't necessarily so.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/735542","words":[{"g":"no / not"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"like this"}]}]}